<%- include('partials/header'); -%>

    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-inner">
            <div class="headings">
                <h2>Milkshakes</h2>
                <p>Hand-blended the old-fashioned way &mdash; real ice cream, real milk, and a handful of classic mix-ins. No shortcuts, no syrups from a gun.</p>
                <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipes</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image">
                <img src="/MILKSHAKES.png" alt="Assortment of Cold Stone Creamery milkshakes">
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="about">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="about-image">
                <img src="/milkshake.png" alt="Strawberry milkshake in a glass">
            </div>
            <div class="about-copy">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <h3>About Cold Stone Creamery</h3>
                    <div class="rule"></div>
                </div>
                <p>We started with one simple idea: a milkshake should taste like the ice cream it's made from. Every recipe here uses full-fat ice cream, whole milk, and fresh mix-ins &mdash; nothing artificial, nothing pre-mixed.</p>
                <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">Read More</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="featured">
        <div class="wrap section-head">
            <h3>Our Featured Milkshakes</h3>
            <div class="rule"></div>
            <p>Five classics, blended fresh to order</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="recipes">
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/milkshake.png" alt="Very Strawberry milkshake">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Very Strawberry</h4>
                    <p>Fresh strawberries, vanilla ice cream, and a splash of milk, blended smooth.</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/choc-shake.png" alt="Chocolate milkshake">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Chocolate</h4>
                    <p>Rich chocolate ice cream with whole milk and all-natural chocolate sauce.</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/vanilla.png" alt="Cherry Vanilla milkshake">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Cherry Vanilla</h4>
                    <p>Cherry vanilla ice cream with dark sweet cherries and a touch of vanilla.</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/pb.png" alt="Peanut Butter milkshake">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Peanut Butter</h4>
                    <p>Vanilla ice cream blended with creamy peanut butter and a hint of vanilla.</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/peppermint.png" alt="Peppermint Bark Float">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Peppermint Bark Float</h4>
                    <p>Peppermint bark ice cream, cocoa, and dark chocolate over whole milk.</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="see-more">
            <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">See All Recipes</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <div class="wrap section-head">
            <h3>Why You'll Love It</h3>
            <div class="rule"></div>
            <p>What makes our shakes different</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wrap service-grid">
            <div class="service-card">
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3c-3 0-5.5 2.5-5.5 6 0 2 .8 3.6 2 5l1 8h5l1-8c1.2-1.4 2-3 2-5 0-3.5-2.5-6-5.5-6z"/></svg>
                <h4>Real Ice Cream</h4>
                <p>Every shake starts with full-fat ice cream, not a mix or a soft-serve base.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 4l16 16M20 4L4 20"/></svg>
                <h4>Classic Recipes</h4>
                <p>Five tried-and-true flavors, the same way they've always been made.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
                <h4>Made To Order</h4>
                <p>Blended fresh when you order &mdash; never pre-made or left sitting.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonial">
        <div class="wrap section-head">
            <h3>Testimonial</h3>
            <div class="rule"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-card">
            <p>&ldquo;The cherry vanilla shake tastes exactly like the ice cream it's made from &mdash; not like a fast food milkshake at all. It's become our Friday night tradition.&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="testimonial-avatar">JM</div>
            <h4>Jamie M., regular customer</h4>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer'); -%>
